                dedicated CSS for this subset of the full effects list (every
                [data-caption-buider='1'] override in grid-gallery.galleries.effects.css) - the
                rest render broken under Builder's structure (wrong height/background, no real
                animation - see the frontend gate in helpers.twig's galleryTypeBlock, which
                already falls back any of these to quarter-appear there). Filtering the picker
                itself to just the working set - same pattern already used a few lines down for
                "Captions effects with icons", which is hidden outright in Builder mode - avoids
                letting the user pick something that silently won't do what they chose. Legacy
                Captions (Caption Builder disabled) is untouched, still sees and can pick from
                the full list. #}
